ast daily close at or before 30 days ago. coverage names the markets not yet tagged; its classifiedOpenInterestShare is the tagged markets' open interest over its openInterestUsd, the sum across the markets that report one. Open interest and volume, per sector and in coverage, are over the venues with a reading this hour: coverage's venuesExcluded names the venues listing a market without one (archive_day_behind: Binance and Bybit, whose public archives run a day behind; timed_out or not_recorded: a venue the hour could not read), and its shareOf says OI only when every venue listing a market reports one this hour, else reported OI.\"}}"}],"isError":false}}

